      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The saved calibration doesn't really have to be loaded automatically. Instead, when VRChat doesn't have yet calibration data from the current season, it will show half of the calibrate button in quick menu as \"use calibration from last session\" or something similar.\n\nThis will ensure quick and easy access to the feature and will not cause unnecessary trouble when you don't want it.",
